This repository contains an original LIN/C11 experimental clone of a published
scalar algorithm from Aave V3 (aave/aave-v3-core). The upstream Solidity is
NOT vendored here.

Upstream algorithm license: MIT after BUSL Change Date 2023-01-27.
See https://github.com/aave/aave-v3-core

The LIN source and C11 oracle in this repository are provided for audit
reproduction. Proofs live in https://github.com/kbelludoo/lin-open
